# Merge sms-gateway into asterisk-docker

The host gateway in this repo stays the base. It already talks to each Asterisk
container over AMI. The standalone tree at `/home/ht/sourcecode/sms-gateway` is
the source for UI and for features that do not need a serial modem.

## Keep

- `sms-gateway/src/modem/ami_transport.rs` and `sms-gateway/src/modem/transport.rs`
- `sms-gateway/src/readers_db.rs` and `sms-gateway/src/sim_inventory.rs`
- `sim_inventory.db` for readers and SIMs (`scripts/sim_db.py`)
- Gateway SQLite for messages, calls, Firefox, barcode scans, and MMS rows
- Host process on AMI `127.0.0.1` ports (not a compose service)
- SMS inbox, call log, and SIM dashboard, refreshed from the newer Svelte UI
- Firefox upload, stats, and money (HTTP client + SQLite). Incoming SMS is
  already stored by AMI, so the poll worker reads the gateway database.
- Barcode submit, list, clear, file scan, and import into `sim_cards.phone_number`
- MMS list, detail, inbox, and profile read/write
- eSIM and MMS send pages, with those actions returning HTTP 501

## Drop

- Serial AT stack: `modem/core.rs`, `pdu.rs`, `ftp_uploader.rs`, `vendor/`
- `POST /api/at/{com_port}`
- USSD, call-exchange, SMS-exchange (`POST` returns 501)
- Write-MSISDN-to-SIM (`POST /api/sims/{sim_id}/phone` returns 501)
- Force-register, re-register, port restart, `AT+CPMS` storage
- `mms_worker`, `mms_retrieve`, `mms_wap`, and `src/esim/` (lpac / modem session)
- Migrations `20260716000001_esim.sql` and `20260818000001_ftp_apn.sql`
- `SimSetPhonePage` and the dashboard controls that only exist for AT modems

## File map

| From `/home/ht/sourcecode/sms-gateway` | Into this repo |
| --- | --- |
| `src/firefox_api.rs`, `firefox_upload_retry.rs`, `firefox_upload_retry_worker.rs` | `sms-gateway/src/` |
| `src/service_control.rs` | `sms-gateway/src/` |
| Firefox poll + catalog sync from `src/main.rs` | `sms-gateway/src/firefox_poll.rs` (DB read, not modem poll) |
| Firefox / phone / MMS handlers from `src/api/mod.rs` | `sms-gateway/src/api/{firefox,phone,mms}.rs` |
| eSIM route list | `sms-gateway/src/api/esim.rs` stubs (501) |
| Firefox, MMS, barcode migrations | `sms-gateway/migrations/` |
| Matching queries | `sms-gateway/src/db.rs` |
| Svelte pages and `frontend/src/js/{api,i18n,country,modem}.js` | `sms-gateway/frontend/` |

`GET /api/sims/info` stays the AMI payload. Signal, operator, and registration
stay empty when the transport cannot answer them.
